{"page":300,"verses":[{"verse_key":"18:54","surah":18,"ayah":54,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ صَرَّفْنَا فِى هَـٰذَا ٱلْقُرْءَانِ لِلنَّاسِ مِن كُلِّ مَثَلٍ ۚ وَكَانَ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ أَكْثَرَ شَىْءٍ جَدَلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"In this Quran We have presented every kind of description for people but man is more contentious than any other creature.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And certainly","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"18:54"},{"pos":2,"ar":"صَرَّفْنَا","en_gloss":"We have explained","transliteration":"ṣarrafnā","verse_key":"18:54"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"18:54"},{"pos":4,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"this","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"18:54"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْقُرْءَانِ","en_gloss":"the Quran","transliteration":"l-qur'āni","verse_key":"18:54"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"for mankind","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","verse_key":"18:54"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"18:54"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"18:54"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَثَلٍۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"example","transliteration":"mathalin","verse_key":"18:54"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَكَانَ","en_gloss":"But is","transliteration":"wakāna","verse_key":"18:54"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","en_gloss":"the man","transliteration":"l-insānu","verse_key":"18:54"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَكْثَرَ","en_gloss":"(in) most","transliteration":"akthara","verse_key":"18:54"},{"pos":13,"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ","en_gloss":"things","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"18:54"},{"pos":14,"ar":"جَدَلًۭا","en_gloss":"quarrelsome","transliteration":"jadalan","verse_key":"18:54"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٥٤","en_gloss":"(54)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"18:54"}]},{"verse_key":"18:55","surah":18,"ayah":55,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا مَنَعَ ٱلنَّاسَ أَن يُؤْمِنُوٓا۟ إِذْ جَآءَهُمُ ٱلْهُدَىٰ وَيَسْتَغْفِرُوا۟ رَبَّهُمْ إِلَّآ أَن تَأْتِيَهُمْ سُنَّةُ ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ أَوْ يَأْتِيَهُمُ ٱلْعَذَابُ قُبُلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Now that guidance has come to them, what stops these people believing and asking forgiveness from their Lord before the fate of earlier peoples annihilates them or their torment confronts them?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And nothing","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"18:55"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَنَعَ","en_gloss":"prevents","transliteration":"manaʿa","verse_key":"18:55"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسَ","en_gloss":"men","transliteration":"l-nāsa","verse_key":"18:55"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"18:55"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they believe","transliteration":"yu'minū","verse_key":"18:55"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"18:55"},{"pos":7,"ar":"جَآءَهُمُ","en_gloss":"has come to them","transliteration":"jāahumu","verse_key":"18:55"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْهُدَىٰ","en_gloss":"the guidance","transliteration":"l-hudā","verse_key":"18:55"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَيَسْتَغْفِرُوا۟","en_gloss":"and they ask forgiveness","transliteration":"wayastaghfirū","verse_key":"18:55"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رَبَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"(of) their Lord","transliteration":"rabbahum","verse_key":"18:55"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِلَّآ","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"18:55"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"18:55"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَأْتِيَهُمْ","en_gloss":"comes to them","transliteration":"tatiyahum","verse_key":"18:55"},{"pos":14,"ar":"سُنَّةُ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sunnatu","verse_key":"18:55"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the former (people)","transliteration":"l-awalīna","verse_key":"18:55"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"18:55"},{"pos":17,"ar":"يَأْتِيَهُمُ","en_gloss":"comes to them","transliteration":"yatiyahumu","verse_key":"18:55"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابُ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābu