18:56"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَٱتَّخَذُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"And they take","transliteration":"wa-ittakhadhū","verse_key":"18:56"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِى","en_gloss":"My Verses","transliteration":"āyātī","verse_key":"18:56"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"18:56"},{"pos":17,"ar":"أُنذِرُوا۟","en_gloss":"they are warned","transliteration":"undhirū","verse_key":"18:56"},{"pos":18,"ar":"هُزُوًۭا","en_gloss":"(in) ridicule","transliteration":"huzuwan","verse_key":"18:56"},{"pos":19,"ar":"٥٦","en_gloss":"(56)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"18:56"}]},{"verse_key":"18:57","surah":18,"ayah":57,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَنْ أَظْلَمُ مِمَّن ذُكِّرَ بِـَٔايَـٰتِ رَبِّهِۦ فَأَعْرَضَ عَنْهَا وَنَسِىَ مَا قَدَّمَتْ يَدَاهُ ۚ إِنَّا جَعَلْنَا عَلَىٰ قُلُوبِهِمْ أَكِنَّةً أَن يَفْقَهُوهُ وَفِىٓ ءَاذَانِهِمْ وَقْرًا ۖ وَإِن تَدْعُهُمْ إِلَى ٱلْهُدَىٰ فَلَن يَهْتَدُوٓا۟ إِذًا أَبَدًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Who could be more wrong than the person who is reminded of his Lord’s messages and turns his back on them, ignoring what his hands are storing up for him [in the Hereafter]? We have put covers over their hearts, so they cannot understand the Quran, and We put heaviness in their ears: although you call them to guidance [Prophet] they will never accept it.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَنْ","en_gloss":"And who","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"18:57"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَظْلَمُ","en_gloss":"(is) more wrong","transliteration":"aẓlamu","verse_key":"18:57"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِمَّن","en_gloss":"than (he) who","transliteration":"mimman","verse_key":"18:57"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ذُكِّرَ","en_gloss":"is reminded","transliteration":"dhukkira","verse_key":"18:57"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"of the Verses","transliteration":"biāyāti","verse_key":"18:57"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رَبِّهِۦ","en_gloss":"(of) his Lord","transliteration":"rabbihi","verse_key":"18:57"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَأَعْرَضَ","en_gloss":"but turns away","transliteration":"fa-aʿraḍa","