]},{"verse_key":"18:60","surah":18,"ayah":60,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذْ قَالَ مُوسَىٰ لِفَتَىٰهُ لَآ أَبْرَحُ حَتَّىٰٓ أَبْلُغَ مَجْمَعَ ٱلْبَحْرَيْنِ أَوْ أَمْضِىَ حُقُبًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Moses said to his servant, ‘I will not rest until I reach the place where the two seas meet, even if it takes me years!’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذْ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idh","verse_key":"18:60"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"18:60"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مُوسَىٰ","en_gloss":"Musa","transliteration":"mūsā","verse_key":"18:60"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِفَتَىٰهُ","en_gloss":"to his boy","transliteration":"lifatāhu","verse_key":"18:60"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَآ","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"18:60"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَبْرَحُ","en_gloss":"I will cease","transliteration":"abraḥu","verse_key":"18:60"},{"pos":7,"ar":"حَتَّىٰٓ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"18:60"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَبْلُغَ","en_gloss":"I reach","transliteration":"ablugha","verse_key":"18:60"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَجْمَعَ","en_gloss":"the junction","transliteration":"majmaʿa","verse_key":"18:60"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْبَحْرَيْنِ","en_gloss":"(of) the two seas","transliteration":"l-baḥrayni","verse_key":"18:60"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"18:60"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَمْضِىَ","en_gloss":"I continue","transliteration":"amḍiya","verse_key":"18:60"},{"pos":13,"ar":"حُقُبًۭا","en_gloss":"(for) a long period","transliteration":"ḥuquban","verse_key":"18:60"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٦٠","en_gloss":"(60)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"18:60"}]},{"verse_key":"18:61","surah":18,"ayah":61,"ar_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا بَلَغَا مَجْمَعَ بَيْنِهِمَا نَسِيَا حُوتَهُمَا فَٱتَّخَذَ سَبِيلَهُۥ فِى ٱلْبَحْرِ سَرَبًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but when they reached the place where the two seas meet, they had forgotten all about their fish, which made its way into the sea and swam away.","words":[{"pos":1,"